<p>Make your target's diseases burst, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">68, 92, 110, 125, 139</acronym> blight damage for each disease it is infected with.</p><p>This will also spread any diseases to any nearby foes in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 3</acronym> with a minimum duration of 6.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>